aqueousThermo
{
source "hfAq [kJ/mol] -980.72: printed dHf(aq) of L-glutamic acid -- Miller & Smith-Magowan, J. Phys. Chem. Ref. Data 19 (1990) 1049, Table 3, p. 1054 (read from a page image) ## sAq [J/mol/K] 246.90: printed S(aq) of L-glutamic acid -- Miller & Smith-Magowan, J. Phys. Chem. Ref. Data 19 (1990) 1049, Table 3, p. 1054 (read from a page image)";
